    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 4A Booterstown Avenue is a turn-key three-bedroom mid terrace house which is situated within striking distance Blackrock village. This home is packed with character and superb features such as its modern kitchen, large living room and its beautifully landscaped rear garden. Situated within easy reach of a wide range of excellent amenities, school, transport links and parks, this stunning property is sure to be of interest to a wide audience. \n\nThe accommodation offers a feeling of space and brightness throughout and briefly comprises of an entrance hallway leading to a modern kitchen/dining room, a living room to the front with a door leading to the guest w.c. and utility room. To the rear there is a separate family room with access to the rear garden and an orangery with access to the garden. Upstairs there are two double bedrooms, a single bedroom and a family bathroom.\n\nOutside the property doesn't disappoint, to the rear the private garden measures approx. 15.5m x 9m. It is mainly laid in paving and grass with a feature stone wall and raised flower beds. There is a second raised patio area with stunning sea views and access to an outhouse/storeroom.\n\nSituated on Booterstown Avenue the location needs little introduction with every possible amenity that South Dublin has to offer within easy reach. Ideally situated a short stroll from Booterstown Dart station at the bottom of Booterstown Avenue as well as several bus routes operating regularly along the Rock Road. The property is also surrounded by some of Dublin's finest schools with St. Andrews College, Blackrock College and Willow Park all within walking distance as well as nearby UCD and Trinity College along the Dart line. Blackrock, Merrion and Stillorgan Villages are within easy reach as are Blackrock Clinic, St. Vincent's Hospital and RTE."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nKitchen/Dining Room: - \nWith tiled flooring, wooden wall paneling, recessed lighting, feature brick wall, a range of modern floor and wall units, integrated oven/hobs, integrated bin storage, integrated dish washer, integrated fridge/freezer, integrated microwave, tiled back splash and built in bench seating.\n\nLiving Room: - \nWith wooden flooring, ceiling coving, a sash window to the front, a feature solid fuel stove and built in storage units.\n\nGuest W.C: - \nWith tiled flooring, w.c. wash hand basin and wall paneling.\n\nOrangery: - \nWith tiled flooring, vaulted ceiling, access to eve storage, a door to the utility room and a door to the garden.\n\nUtility Room: - \nWith tiled flooring, sink with drainer, skylight, plumbed for washer/dryer and built in storage.\n\nFamily Room: - \nA dual aspect room with wooden flooring, recessed lighting, feature wooden beams, a feature gas fire, wall lighting, a large window to the rear and a door to the rear garden.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nDouble room with built in wardrobes, a sash window to the front, feature wall arches and tv/phone points.\n\nFamily Bathroom: - \nWith tiled flooring and partly tiled walls, w.c. wash hand basin, bidet, chrome wall mounted heated towel rail, recessed lighting, shower and shelved hot-press.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nDouble room with a sash window to the front, built in wardrobes and feature wooden wall paneling.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nSingle room with a window to the rear and access to the attic.\n\nOuthouse: - \nWith wooden flooring, electricity, wooden wall panelling, a window to the front and a seperate storage room.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Turn-key three-bedroom house</li><li> Tastefully presented throughout</li><li> Permit parking</li><li> Beautifully landscaped rear garden with sea views</li><li> Gas fired central heating</li><li> Newly fitted sash windows</li><li> Easy access to transport links and premier local schools</li><li> Walking distance to Blackrock Village</li><li> Adjacent to Blackrock Park</ul>"
      },
